3 days ago was Cinderella, 2 days ago was Shiroi Yuki no Princess wa, and 1 day...

280
00:30:00,368 --> 00:30:01,428
マイがムーンプライとでしたー！
That was 'My Grand Moonlight'!

281
00:30:01,928 --> 00:30:06,168
是非ね、配信終わったあとに練習風景も見たいなって方は
If you'd like to see the practice footage

282
00:30:06,168 --> 00:30:08,768
そちらのショートも、見てみてください！
after the stream ends, please check out those Shorts!

283
00:30:08,968 --> 00:30:13,968
いやご、いろはを責めること、一気にがーって責めるとき、
Well, when I blame myself, blaming myself all at once...

