329
00:35:55,816 --> 00:35:58,516
そのために必要な勇気を
Even if a cruel fate is predetermined,

330
00:35:58,516 --> 00:36:01,376
探し求めていた
Even if it appears before me one day,

331
00:36:01,376 --> 00:36:05,836
残酷な運命が決まっているとして
If I can breathe for just a moment, just this moment,

332
00:36:05,836 --> 00:36:08,576
それがいつの日か僕の前に現れるとして
My heart felt that nothing else mattered.

333
00:36:08,576 --> 00:36:13,256
ただ一瞬 この一瞬 息ができるなら
Someone inside me sings,

334
00:36:13,256 --> 00:36:17,906
どうでもいいと思えた その心を
"Go further away, go further away,"

335
00:36:17,906 --> 00:36:21,106
もう一度 遠くへ行け 遠くへ行けと
With an uncontrollable, passionate fervor.

336
00:36:21,106 --> 00:36:23,156
僕の中で誰かが歌う
So that you, with your eyes always swollen from crying,

337
00:36:23,156 --> 00:36:27,476
どうしようもないほど烈烈に
Will never have to be sad again and can smile—

338
