362
00:37:53,356 --> 00:37:58,556
ガサガサばかり荒れ果てた日々が
Revive through your words,

363
00:37:58,556 --> 00:38:03,156
削り削られ擦り切れた今が
Vividly appearing before us.

364
00:38:03,156 --> 00:38:05,706
君の言葉で蘇る
The soul sleeping as a chrysalis,

365
00:38:05,706 --> 00:38:08,556
鮮やかにも 現れていく
That dream abandoned half-eaten—

366
00:38:08,556 --> 00:38:13,256
蛹のままで眠る魂を
Retrieve them once more.

367
00:38:13,256 --> 00:38:17,856
食べかけのまま捨てたあの夢を
Someone inside me sings,

368
00:38:17,856 --> 00:38:20,356
もう一度取り戻せ
"Go further away, go further away,"

369
00:38:20,356 --> 00:38:23,306
もう一度 遠くへ行け 遠くへ行けと
Once more, with an uncontrollable fervor.

370
00:38:23,306 --> 00:38:25,806
僕の中で誰かが歌う
So that you can smile and never be sad again—

371
00:38:25,806 --> 00:38:30,256
どうしようもないほど烈烈に
This is a song to become a hero like that.

372
