眠りに就く枕元の Secret Girl
A Secret Girl falling asleep by her pillow,

563
00:59:11,888 --> 00:59:15,588
まだ見つからない夢探しに行こう
Let's go search for a dream we haven't found yet.

564
00:59:21,888 --> 00:59:24,888
雨の日でも 晴れの日でも
Even on rainy days, even on sunny days,

565
00:59:24,888 --> 00:59:28,588
まっすぐに咲いてる花のように
Like a flower blooming straight and true,

566
00:59:28,888 --> 00:59:31,588
いつだって ずっと どこだって そっと
Always forever, everywhere gently,

567
00:59:31,588 --> 00:59:35,588
輝く魔法を Let's go!
Shining magic, Let's go!

568
00:59:35,888 --> 00:59:38,888
Let's go! ときめいた青空で
Let's go! In a sparkling blue sky,

569
00:59:38,888 --> 00:59:42,588
もっと風に乗りきらめくの Dreaming
glittering even more on the wind, Dreaming

570
00:59:43,088 --> 00:59:45,588
今より可愛くなりたい
I want to be cuter than now,

571
00:59:45,588 --> 00:59:49,588
キュンとね想いこんなんでもバキュンだ!
with a throbbing feeling like this, it's a direct hit!

572
01:00:03,246 --> 01:00:06,496
華やかなドレス身に纏い
Wearing a gorgeous dress,

573
01:00:06,746 --> 01:00:10,646
誰かを待つ憧れの princess girl
waiting for someone, an adored princess girl.

574
01:00:10,946 --> 01:00:15,646
あーなりたい理想と比べてばっか
Ah, always comparing myself to the ideal I want to be.

575
01:00:16,546 --> 01:00:19,946
道に迷って1人悩んで
Getting lost on the path and worrying alone,

576
01:00:20,046 --> 01:00:23,446
挫れそうになっても大丈夫！
even if I feel like giving up, it's alright!

577
01:00:23,596 --> 01:00:26,846
君と出会って笑顔になって
Meeting you and breaking into a smile,

578
01:00:26,996 --> 01:00:30,346
輝く魔法 Let's Go!
shining magic, Let's Go!

579
01:00:30,646 --> 01:00:33,546
ありふれた日常も
Even ordinary everyday life

580
01:00:33,646 --> 01:00:36,846
もっと風吹いて動き出す jumping
starts moving more as the wind blows, jumping.

581
01:00:37,446 --> 01:00:40,546
飛び立つ希望を探して
Searching for hope to take flight,

582
01:00:40,746 --> 01:00:44,946
弾ける想いは何度でもバッキュンだ！
my bursting feelings hit you with a "bakkyun!" every time!

583
01:00:48,046 --> 01:00:50,946
助けられるだけじゃない
It's not just about being helped,

584
01:00:51,046 --> 01:00:53,746
