I want to protect as well.

585
01:00:53,846 --> 01:00:57,246
そう！ずっと思い描いた
Yes! Connecting the days

586
01:00:57,346 --> 01:01:01,446
日々を繋いで重なるいろは
I always envisioned, our colors overlap.

587
01:01:03,096 --> 01:01:06,196
やっと気づいた本当の願い
Finally realizing my true wish,

588
01:01:06,296 --> 01:01:09,746
なんてちょっぴりお大げさだけどどうかな
though it's a bit of an exaggeration, I wonder how it sounds.

589
01:01:10,146 --> 01:01:14,346
この時間がいつまでも続きますように
May this time last forever,

590
01:01:14,446 --> 01:01:16,946
君と今 Let's Go!
with you now, Let's Go!

591
01:01:17,046 --> 01:01:20,046
ときめいた青空で
In the throbbing blue sky,

592
01:01:20,246 --> 01:01:23,446
もっと風に乗りきらめくの dreaming
riding the wind more and sparkling, dreaming.

593
01:01:23,846 --> 01:01:26,646
今より可愛くなりたい
I want to become cuter than now,

594
01:01:26,846 --> 01:01:30,646
キュートな想いは何度でもバッキュンだ！
cute feelings hitting you with a "bakkyun!" no matter how many times!

595
01:02:17,446 --> 01:02:23,046
みなさん、このライブも最後の曲になりました。今回は3回目の誕生日なので
Everyone, this live has reached its final song. Since this is my 3rd birthday,

596
01:02:23,096 --> 01:02:25,946
「愛言葉III」を歌って終わりにします。
I'll sing "Aikotoba III" to wrap it up.

597
01:02:25,946 --> 01:02:29,046
今日は本当に来てくれてありがとうございました！
Thank you so much for coming today!

598
01:02:31,596 --> 01:02:37,796
想いの冒険を 忘れずに全部言えるかな
Can I recount the adventure of my feelings without forgetting anything?

599
01:02:38,046 --> 01:02:44,996
君から聞きたいよ 何回目の僕に出会った?
I want to hear it from you—how many times have you met me?

600
01:02:45,146 --> 01:02:48,396
僕は変わりました 新しい君に出会うために
I have changed, in order to meet a new you.

601
01:02:48,646 --> 01:02:52,646
久しぶりだねって 言えたならここで泣きそうかっ
If I could say "It's been a while," I'd probably cry right here.

602
01:02:52,746 --> 01:02:59,896
好きとかって 嫌いとかって 何度だって愛を歌う君が
You, who sing of love over and over, saying "I like you" or "I hate you,"

603
01:03:00,046 --> 01:03:05,996
恋しくって 嘘じゃない本当だよ また出会おう
I miss you, and it's no lie, it's the truth—let's meet again.

604
01:03:13,396 --> 01:03:20,996
僕ら“II”を嫌って“I”に戻って 何回だって間違ってきたよ
We hated "II", went back to "I", and made mistakes countless times.

605
01:03:21,146 --> 01:03:26,646
消えない後悔と 冷めない愛情が 恋を再起動する
Unfading regrets and unwavering affection reboot our romance.

606
01:03:27,196 --> 01:03:34,396
ほら“I”を嫌ってまた“II”に戻って “III”になって愛を繋いでいこう
Look, let's hate "I", go back to "II", become "III", and keep connecting our love.

607
01:03:34,596 --> 01:03:41,096
言いたい感情は 伝えたい正解は
The feelings I want to express, the correct answer I want to convey,

608
01:03:41,196 --> 01:03:44,496
想いの冒険は これからもちゃんと続いていく
and the adventure of our feelings will properly continue from now on.

609
01:04:02,596 --> 01:04:09,246
3と9に乗って 言葉とか飛び越えちゃって
Riding on 3 and 9, leaping right past words and all,

610
01:04:09,596 --> 01:04:12,846
君も変わりました 新しい誰かに会うために
you too have changed, in order to meet someone new.

611
01:04:13,096 --> 01:04:19,546
大人になりました それだけでいいと思えた
I became an adult, and I felt that alone was enough.

612
01:04:22,596 --> 01:04:30,096
好きとかって 嫌いとかって 何度だって愛を歌う君が
You, who sing of love over and over, saying "I like you" or "I hate you,"

613
01:04:30,396 --> 01:04:36,596
恋しくって 嘘じゃない本当だよ また出会おう
I miss you, and it's no lie, it's the truth—let's meet again.

614
01:04:51,096 --> 01:04:55,096
恋をして バカ… 愛にして バカ…
Falling in love, idiot... Turning it into love, idiot...

615
01:04:55,196 --> 01:04:59,596
バカでいい この先もずっとこのままバカ…
Idiotic is fine, staying just like this forever... idiot...

616
01:05:00,454 --> 01:05:04,654
バカでいい この先もずっとこのまま
Stupid is fine, let's stay just like this forever...

617
01:05:06,734 --> 01:05:09,234
僕ら“II”を嫌って“I”に戻って
Wishing on "II" and returning to "I",

618
01:05:09,734 --> 01:05:14,834
何回だって 間違って来たよ
How many times have I made this mistake?

619
01:05:15,434 --> 01:05:20,334
消えない後悔と 冷めない感情が恋を再起動する
Unfading regrets and lingering passion reignite our love.

620
01:05:21,034 --> 01:05:28,534
ほら“I”を嫌って また“II”に戻って“III”になって 愛を繋いでいこう
Moving from "I" to "II", then to "III", let's connect our love.

621
01:05:29,434 --> 01:05:33,934
言いたい感情は 伝えたい正解はたったひとつだけ
The feelings I want to say, the truths I want to convey are just one.

622
01:05:34,434 --> 01:05:38,334
ありがとう
Thank you!

623
01:05:35,434 --> 01:05:38,934
メーデー 僕と判っても
Mayday, if you find out it's me...

624
01:05:39,134 --> 01:05:41,934
もう抱き締めなくていいんだよ もっとちゃんと不安にしてよ
You don't need to hold me tight, just make me anxious.

625
01:05:43,434 --> 01:05:46,434
愛を懐いて理想を号んだ
Embracing love and shouting ideals.

626
01:05:46,734 --> 01:05:49,934
行き場のある愛のメロディーを
Singing a homeless love melody.

627
01:05:50,134 --> 01:05:55,434
これまでにありがとう いつまでも君と
Thank you for everything up until now, and forever with you.

628
01:05:56,634 --> 01:06:04,634
「こんな歌あったね」って 出会い数を数えられるように
So we can count all our meetings as "We had songs like that."

